      "id": "KvAsm.Client",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "KvNode was renamed KvAsm and moved to the AsmFoundation. Use KvAsm.Client (https://github.com/AsmFoundation/KvAsm). The rename is breaking: KvAsm.Client speaks the kvasm.v1 protocol of KvAsm servers (ghcr.io/asmfoundation/kvasm), not KvNode 0.2.0.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": ".NET client for KvNode, the gRPC key-value server written in x86-64 assembly: Get/Put/Delete, streaming Upload/Download of large values and ranges with CRC-32C verification, health checks, long-key compaction and snapshot file writing.",
